# Everything in this repository is LF, everywhere, forever.
#
# The Thunderbird add-on and the gateway are read by tools that compare exact
# strings (header names, preference names, JSON keys) and by a test suite that
# rejects CRLF in any text file. A single CRLF on a Windows checkout therefore
# turns into a red check, so the normalisation is declared here instead of being
# left to each contributor's editor.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary payloads that must never be rewritten.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.xpi binary
*.ots binary

# OpenTimestamps proofs are line-oriented hex; they are text.
*.ots.txt text eol=lf

# Git's own files.
.gitattributes text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf

# PowerShell is consumed by Windows, but it parses LF fine and the tree is
# validated as LF-only, so it stays text.
*.ps1 text eol=lf
